{"message":"I have the details for all eight requested disputes and will not include any other Costco or Amazon transactions. Before I submit them, please provide the last four digits of your personal Gold Rewards Card so I can associate each dispute with the correct card.

Provisional-credit eligibility is currently indicated for the two fraudulent charges and the two duplicate charges. The goods-not-as-described, incorrect-amount, cancelled-subscription, and refund-not-processed disputes do not qualify under the applicable criteria, though they will still be filed for investigation.

For the replacement card, please also confirm that it should be sent to your registered address and choose standard delivery (7–10 business days, no fee) or expedited delivery (2–3 business days)."}

